# Drop-in build artifacts (the MediaPipe .task model, the MediaPipe wasm bundle) land under
# apps/capture/public and must stay out of the repo; apps/capture/.gitignore names both explicitly.
# The trailing `*` matters: excluding the directory itself would make the negation below impossible,
# because git never descends into an excluded directory to re-include anything inside it.
# public/fonts IS source — the self-hosted Oswald/Inter woff2 the capture page @font-faces. Without
# this negation a fresh clone builds /capture/ with no fonts and silently falls back to system faces.
apps/capture/public/*
!apps/capture/public/fonts/
apps/capture/.native-spike/
apps/capture/.native-game/
# Local-only scratch copy of the original Python prototype and its venv. Cannot be committed even
# if we wanted to: GitHub rejects any blob over 100MB, and this carries a 386MB libtorch_cpu.dylib,
# a 160MB polars runtime and a 462MB zip of itself.
Prototype/
Prototype.zip

# Local runtime and cache files from the supplied resource folders.
resources/**/rag-env/
resources/**/__MACOSX/
resources/**/chroma_db/
resources/**/.DS_Store
*.crdownload
